<div class = "userlogin_container">
<p>Password Account Management System is a password manager created for my 1004 module of my first university year.
   With it you can store passwords, "log-in" passwords to check if they have saved properly, test password strength
   using the password strength bar, find forgotten credentials with the forgotten username and password pages, save
   credentials in the form with the rememberme checkbox, and more.</p>
<p>If confused on how to use the website please refer to the help page in the navbar for relevant information.</p>
